WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.174
There’s no air in space.

2
00:00:02.174 --> 00:00:06.087
But this rocket carries its own fuel and oxygen,

3
00:00:06.087 --> 00:00:10.000
so it has both ingredients it needs to burn.

4
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.478
The fuel and oxygen meet in this chamber.

5
00:00:13.478 --> 00:00:16.087
They burn and make hot gas.

6
00:00:16.087 --> 00:00:20.000
The nozzle speeds that gas out of the engine.

7
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.143
As the engine throws gas backward,

8
00:00:22.143 --> 00:00:24.286
the gas pushes the rocket forward.

9
00:00:24.286 --> 00:00:26.786
It doesn’t need to push against air.

10
00:00:26.786 --> 00:00:30.000
That’s how a rocket can fly through empty space.
